  "description": "#6054 D2 — `Not` over the leaves the mock used to answer with a silent `true`, which under a `Not` became an empty set where the backend gives the complement. The advanced query covers `ChildOf`, `Space`, `Created`, `LinkedFrom` and `HasParentMatching` (whose matcher reads the PARENT row, its last-edited stamp included), plus the refusals of a Search-only leaf, of a Pages-only leaf inside a matcher and of a malformed `created` bound. The References panel covers `PropertyNum`, `PropertyDate`, `DueDate` and `CreatedInRange`, plus the `DueDate` `Contains` and malformed-bound refusals. Every leaf has rows on both sides and a row with no value: B6 and B7 hold no property or due date, the root pages B1 and B2 have no parent. B7's id is a literal ULID from 2025-06-15; the padded seed ids date to the epoch. Re-author `expected` via CONFORMANCE_UPDATE=1.",
